---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: misc
description: Friends, web pages, and books.
---
<h1>More things!</h1>

<h2 id="friends"><a href="#friends" class="heading-link">Friends</a></h2>
<p>Wonderful people who have websites and works of their own:</p>
<div class="friend-strip">
    {%- for f in friends | selectattr("img") %}
    <a href="{{ f.url }}" target="_blank" aria-label="{{ f.name }}: {{ f.desc | escape }}">
        <img src="/assets/friends/{{ f.img }}" alt="{{ f.name }}" class="friend-avatar" loading="eager" width="48" height="48">
<span class="friend-card"><b>{{ f.name }}</b><span class="desc">{{ f.desc }}</span></span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
</div>

<h2 id="pages-talks"><a href="#pages-talks" class="heading-link">Pages &amp; Talks ({{ links | length}})</a></h2>
<ul class="post-list link-list">
    {%- for item in links | sort(false, false, 'title') %}
    <li>
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank">{{ item.title }}</a>
        {% if item.desc %}<span class="desc">{{ item.desc | safe }}</span>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="books"><a href="#books" class="heading-link">Books ({{ books | length}})</a></h2>
<ul class="post-list link-list">
    {%- for book in books | sort(false, false, 'title') %}
    <li>
        {{ book.title }}
        {% if book.desc %}<span class="desc">{{ book.desc | safe }}</span>{% endif %}
    </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="post-description">I keep a fuller log on <a href="https://app.thestorygraph.com/profile/nicosalm">StoryGraph</a>. If you've read any of these, you're more than welcome to {% include "email-link.njk" %} me and we can chat about them (or others!!)</p>

<h2 id="nerd-stuff"><a href="#nerd-stuff" class="heading-link">Nerd stuff</a></h2>
<p>I've been into RPGs for over a decade, playing a lot of over-the-table D&D 5E. I like to draw pen-and-ink and digital maps. More recently, I've also been getting into the Warhammer 40K universe, reading Dan Abnett. I play strategy games on PC, including Total War and Paradox titles. I generally tend towards enjoying older RPGs from studios like Obsidian, CDProjekt, and Bethesda.</p>

